irmed\n          kind: report\n        - id: confirmed_not_registered\n          label: Nonregistration confirmed\n          kind: report\n        - id: no_result\n          label: No usable verification result\n          kind: no-report\n  presentation:\n    labels:\n      baseline: Reserve without another check\n      study: Verification option\n      action: Complete shipment arrangement\n      state: Transportation situation\n      report: Verification result\n    reports:\n      comparison:\n        title: Verification before reservation\n        question: \"Which available choice has the lowest expected cost while retaining a complete feasible response?\"\n      responses:\n        title: Response to each verification result\n        question: \"Which complete arrangement remains permitted after each possible result?\"\n      inputs:\n        title: Shipment and review basis\n        question: \"Which accepted operating checks and probability assessments support this comparison?\"\n  recordTypes: []\ncase:\n  id: SHIP-104-learning\n  scope: ORD-104-r1-SP-A-2026-11-18-profile-1\n  currentTime: 480\n  cashBudget: 650000\n  probabilityBasis:\n    source: \"ASSESSMENT-HYPOTHETICAL-1: Explicit hypothetical probability assessment; not derived from evidence interpretation counts.\"\n    scope: ORD-104-r1-SP-A-2026-11-18-profile-1\n  priors:\n    - state: registered\n      probability: 0.5\n    - state: not_registered\n      probability: 0.5\n  actions:\n    - action: direct\n      cash: 400000\n      deadline: 720\n    - action: backup\n      cash: 600000\n      deadline: 720\n  payoffs:\n    - action: direct\n      state: registered\n      value: -400000\n    - action: direct\n      state: not_registered\n      value: -400000\n    - action: backup\n      state: registered\n      value: -600000\n    - action: backup\n      state: not_registered\n      value: -600000\n  acceptedFacts: []\n  studies:\n    - study: fast_verification\n      fee: 20000\n      duration: 15